#X msg 204 261 channelm \$1;
#X msg 102 261 controllerm \$1;
#X text 33 292 notesIn has to have note value unpacked and sent separatley
and then recombined in the patch. Same goe sfor ctrlIn as aboved but
it is not being used in the patch so its not sent;
